---
import Layout from '@layouts/default.astro';
import genaiscript from '@assets/microsoft.github.io_genaiscript_.webp';
import lit from '@assets/lit.dev_.webp';
import astro from '@assets/astro.build_.webp';
import ArrowForward from '@icons/arrow-forward.svg';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
---

<Layout title="Andrew Noblet- Personal">
  <div class="column flex gap page">
    <div class="gap grid justify-content-center text-align-center">
      <h1>Personal</h1>
      <p class="bold-5 max-width-56">
        Explore personal projects that showcase my passion for web development,
        component architecture, and AI-driven workflows.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="space-0-5"></div>
    <card-component>
      <div class="flex gap justify-content-space-between align-items-center">
        <h2>Astro</h2>
        <div class="tags">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-0-5">
            <tag-component>JavaScript</tag-component>
            <tag-component>TypeScript</tag-component>
            <tag-component>Static Site Generator</tag-component>
            <tag-component>Astro</tag-component>
            <tag-component>Open Source</tag-component>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex-1">
        <Image src={astro} alt="Astro" class="card-image" />
        <ul>
          <li>
            Astro is a modern static site builder focused on performance and
            component-driven architecture.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Production Experience:</strong> I use Astro to build fast, maintainable,
            and composable web projects with a focus on reusability and best practices,
            including this very portfolio site.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Community Involvement:</strong> I engage with the Astro community
            by sharing feedback, testing new features, and contributing insights
            from real-world project implementations.
          </li>
          <li>
            My experience includes creating complex layouts, building reusable
            component systems, and integrating Astro with various frameworks
            like Lit for optimal performance and developer experience.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <a class="gap-0-5 align-self-flex-end" href="https://astro.build/">
        Learn more <ArrowForward />
      </a>
    </card-component>
    <card-component>
      <div class="flex gap justify-content-space-between align-items-center">
        <h2>Lit</h2>
        <div class="tags">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-0-5">
            <tag-component>JavaScript</tag-component>
            <tag-component>TypeScript</tag-component>
            <tag-component>Web Components</tag-component>
            <tag-component>LitElement</tag-component>
            <tag-component>Open Source</tag-component>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex-1">
        <Image src={lit} alt="Lit" class="card-image" />
        <ul>
          <li>
            Lit is a fast, simple library for building web components and
            reactive UIs.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Active Open-Source Contributor:</strong> I have been contributing
            to Lit's ecosystem for over 5 years, providing feedback on APIs, reporting
            issues, and sharing improvements with the core team and community.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Community Engagement:</strong> I participate in discussions on
            GitHub, help other developers troubleshoot issues, and advocate for web
            standards and best practices in the Lit community.
          </li>
          <li>
            My work with Lit includes building production-ready reusable UI
            components, exploring advanced patterns, and implementing complex
            component architectures.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <a class="gap-0-5 align-self-flex-end" href="https://lit.dev/">
        Learn more <ArrowForward />
      </a>
    </card-component>
    <card-component>
      <div class="flex gap justify-content-space-between align-items-center">
        <h2>GenAIScript</h2>
        <div class="tags">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-0-5">
            <tag-component>TypeScript</tag-component>
            <tag-component>Node.js</tag-component>
            <tag-component>AI</tag-component>
            <tag-component>CLI</tag-component>
            <tag-component>OpenAI</tag-component>
            <tag-component>Prompt Engineering</tag-component>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex-1">
        <Image src={genaiscript} alt="GenAIScript" class="card-image" />
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Early Adopter & Contributor:</strong> I am actively learning
            GenAIScript, an open-source scripting language for generative AI workflows
            by Microsoft, and contributing to its growing community.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Open-Source Contributions:</strong> I actively contribute to
            the project by sharing feedback with the Microsoft team, reporting issues
            and bugs, and engaging with other users to improve the project's documentation
            and usability.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Production Implementation:</strong> I am implementing GenAIScript
            in my daily workflow to automate content generation, experiment with
            prompt engineering, and streamline repetitive development tasks using
            AI.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <a
        class="gap-0-5 align-self-flex-end"
        href="https://microsoft.github.io/genaiscript/"
      >
        Learn more <ArrowForward />
      </a>
    </card-component>
  </div>
</Layout>
<style>
  .tags {
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .card-image {
    height: 100%;
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }
</style>
<script>
  import '@components/card';
  import '@components/contact';
  import '@components/tag';
</script>
